{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","全场瞩目"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标敌人造成多次伤害并附带已损失生命值一定比例的额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","沙利叶召唤15张飞牌，指挥飞牌攻击目标，每张飞牌造成40% + 6% ATK伤害，并额外对目标造成其已损失生命值6%的额外伤害，该伤害最高不超过沙利叶攻击力的120%。沙利叶在本技能释放期间霸体。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":95,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每张飞牌造成的伤害提高至45% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每张飞牌造成的伤害提高至50% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每张飞牌造成的伤害提高至55% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每张飞牌造成的伤害提高至60% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","奉命行事"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为队友发放任务，任务完成后使该队友获得能量和攻击力加成；同时自己解锁技能“王牌绝杀”造成更高伤害并击倒目标敌人，同时降低目标敌人的攻击力和护甲。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，为最靠后的2名友军发放任务牌，当其累计对敌人造成沙利叶初始攻击力2000%的伤害或参与击败敌人后，任务完成（在挑战首领的模式中，改为固定在收到任务的第20秒完成任务）。 完成任务的角色立刻回复150能量并使自身获得沙利叶初始攻击力的12% + 1.5%，持续30秒。\n 当总计完成2个任务后，沙利叶会解锁技能“王牌绝杀”：瞬移到场上累计输出最高的敌人身后，使其攻击力和护甲降低30%持续8秒，造成140% + 20% ATK伤害2次并击倒敌人，同时刷新技能“见好就收”的冷却时间；王牌绝杀释放过程期间霸体。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":125,"end":132,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":208,"end":214,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg8"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backest"},{"start":47,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"},{"start":204,"end":218,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":256,"end":258,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","完成任务的角色获得沙利叶的初始攻击力比例提升至13% + 1.5%；“王牌绝杀”的造成的伤害提升至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg8"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","完成任务的角色获得沙利叶的初始攻击力比例提升至14% + 1.5%；“王牌绝杀”的造成的伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg8"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","完成任务的角色获得沙利叶的初始攻击力比例提升至15% + 1.5%；“王牌绝杀”的造成的伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg8"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","见好就收"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","连续在战场上瞬移三次，前两次对周围敌人造成伤害，第三次远离敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","沙利叶在战场上连续瞬移共3次，前两次瞬移选择3格内敌人最密集的格子，对周围1格所有敌人造成120% + 15% ATK伤害；第三次瞬移优先选择范围内距离敌人最远的格子。沙利叶在本技能释放期间霸体。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":55,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":45,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":95,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至130% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至140% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中攻击力提升，“王牌绝杀”完成第一次攻击后攻击力进一步提升。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升9%，沙利叶第一次通过“王牌绝杀”完成攻击后额外提升6%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升12%，沙利叶第一次通过“王牌绝杀”完成攻击后额外提升8%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升15%，沙利叶第一次通过“王牌绝杀”完成攻击后额外提升10%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","幕后支援"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“王牌绝杀”完成攻击后给自己和任务完成的队友永久增加攻击力和急速。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当沙利叶第一次通过“王牌绝杀”完成攻击后，所有完成任务的友军和沙利叶永久获得25急速和沙利叶25%初始攻击力的加成。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","任务完成后的永久攻击力的加成提升至30%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","自身和接受作战任务的友方角色受到最后一击时，立即触发“紧急支援”：使其免于被击败，同时使双方获得200% ATK护盾和20点生命汲取，持续5秒。队友触发“紧急支援”时和沙利叶互换位置，沙利叶自身触发“紧急支援”时不会互换位置，而是刷新技能“见好就收”的冷却时间。每个角色最多触发1次“紧急支援”。\n获得任务的友方角色通过本方法获得的护盾值会随着其任务完成进度等比例提升，最高为100%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":48,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","任务完成后的永久攻击力的加成提升至35%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","队友在接受到任务时获得短暂的攻击力提升和霸体。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","队友在接受任务牌时获得15%攻击力提升和霸体，持续5秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","旋叶"]]}